  "details": "1. Open VRChat with the phone's auto-rotate setting turned off. The app should boot up into a portrait orientation.\n\n2. Once in a world, press the menu button to open your small menu.\n\n3. Open any quick menu item (Worlds, Avatars, etc.)\n\nThe app immediately flips to a Landscape Orientation. Once the menu is closed, it flips back to a Portrait orientation.\n\nThis may be an intended feature, but if so it feels very clunky and unintended.",
